Microsoft moved speech synthesis to api.msedgeservices.com in October 2026;
the legacy speech.platform.bing.com host refuses synthesis with 403.
Port of upstream PR rany2/edge-tts#491 (endpoint + locale-safe date parse).

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/rany2/edge-tts/pull/491]
Signed-off-by: robot-assistant integration <dev@local>

